{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16105100","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16105100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1610510001:1":{"text":"この絵に使われている顔料は、魔法との親和性が高い貴重な鉱石や植物で作られた特製品ですね。キャンバスにも、魔法エネルギーに耐えられるよう特殊な加工が施されているようです。","source_cn":"这幅画的颜料很特殊，几乎都是用亲魔法的名贵的矿石和植物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD4E3CAE6CDC83C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610510002:1":{"text":"それだけではなく、額縁の装飾や彫刻、どれを取っても一級品です。","source_cn":"除此之外，画框、装饰和雕刻工艺也都堪称上乘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC018AEBF27E630AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610510003:1":{"text":"これだけでも、普通の貴族ではとても弁償しきれないでしょうね。","source_cn":"仅仅这些东西，恐怕普通的贵族也负担不起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD974BD2B63419B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610510004:1":{"text":"絵のことはよく分からないけど、何種類もの魔法が付与されているみたいだな。","source_cn":"我不了解绘画，但这幅画上附着了多种魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D19E6A38B3AA6A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610510005:1":{"text":"基本の保存魔法だけじゃなく、誰かが特殊な術式を使って大量の魔力を絵に封じ込めて、色んな効果が現れるようにしているみたいだ。","source_cn":"除了常规的保存魔法之外，有人用一种特殊的术式将大量的魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A8427694F75D8D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610510006:1":{"text":"もしかして、落とした拍子に中の魔力が流れ出たから、絵が消えちゃったのかな？","source_cn":"刚才的损伤造成了画像内的魔力流失，所以这幅画的图案才消失了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB71F093882FF23B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610510007:1":{"text":"だろうな。","source_cn":"是的。<key:dialog62>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x866119C9D5183F24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610510008:1":{"text":"つまり、絵を修復するには、<style=\"highlight\">適した材料</style>を探して傷を直す以外にも、<style=\"highlight\">魔力を封じ込めていた術式を解析</style>し――","source_cn":"想要修复它，除了找到<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0EAEB9CF141193D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610510009:1":{"text":"それで魔法陣を作り、絵に<style=\"highlight\">魔力を注ぎ込む</style>必要があるようですね。","source_cn":"使用对应术式绘制成魔法阵，再为这幅画<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E847690AD301CFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格墨文":{"text":"グレム","source":"格墨文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:休":{"text":"シュー","source":"休","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"ピッパー","source":"皮帕","status":"